  <b>2. Glitch Quarantine System</b>:
     BaridiMob accounts can be quarantined if Algerian Post API exhibits anomalies;
     system automatically rolls back to last_stable_balance for financial calculations.
  <b>3. Proxy Pattern</b>:
     Heavy use of Django proxy models on StellarWallet, BaridiMobAccount,
     CapitalEntry, and WithdrawalRecord to provide family-partitioned administrative views.
  <b>4. Multi-Stage Settlement</b>:
     Withdrawals transition deterministically through ALLOCATED -> BINANCE_P2P -> COMPLETED.
